OL,3,AHospitals deliberately targeted by
OL,4,ASudan's RSF fighters, BBC investigation
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FA BBC investigation has found evidence
OL,8,Fthat Sudanese paramilitary fighters
OL,9,Fsystematically destroyed el-Fasher's
OL,10,Fhealthcare system during their long
OL,11,Fsiege and subsequent takeover of the
OL,12,Fcity in Darfur a year ago.
OL,14,FUN human rights chief Volker Turk
OL,15,Fcalled the findings "deeply
OL,16,Fdisturbing", saying multiple attacks by
OL,17,Fthe Rapid Support Forces (RSF) on
OL,18,Fcivilian infrastructure, including
OL,19,Fhealth facilities, were serious
OL,20,Fviolations of international
OL,21,Fhumanitarian law and may amount to war
OL,22,Fcrimes.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
