OL,3,AHospitals deliberately targeted by
OL,4,ASudan's RSF fighters, BBC investigation
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe RSF has rejected the BBC's
OL,8,Ffindings.
OL,10,FThe paramilitary group's health
OL,11,Fminister described the allegations as
OL,12,Fpropaganda and a deliberate attempt by
OL,13,Fthe national army and its allies to
OL,14,Fsmear the RSF's reputation.
